{"version":1,"key":"card:467","content":{"id":467,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fb3a34f5-3587-4aaf-8564-8cf070332e05","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"只想发出警告，指出情况偏离了正轨，可使用模块 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"warnings"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的函数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"warn"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"dcfdac7c-959f-4bf8-8b9d-cb6f9b9b2bd8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"03bd9300-8bc4-4f97-bdfb-ac9ce95905bf","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> from warnings import warn\n>>> warn(\"I've got a bad feeling about this.\")\n__main__:1: UserWarning: I've got a bad feeling about this.\n>>>","collabId":"d41b4a25-03a3-4d64-80fa-76df455d0f67","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cf136688-def3-4892-9d89-a6b3e3eb59ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"警告只显示一次。如果再次运行最后一行代码，什么事情都不会发生。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20fc00ca-bd50-4c55-93a6-73dcf129e60a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其他代码在使用你的模块，可使用模块 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"warnings"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的函数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"filterwarnings"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来抑制你发出的警告，并指定要采取的措施，如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"error\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"ignore\""},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"f0e6e4f2-d8b1-432e-8f51-fdfbe8dbd8f3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"37f8648b-105d-4551-ae3a-0f7e788ee948","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> from warnings import filterwarnings\n>>> filterwarnings(\"ignore\")\n>>> warn(\"Anyone out there?\")\n>>> filterwarnings(\"error\")\n>>> warn(\"Something is very wrong!\")\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nUserWarning: Something is very wrong!","collabId":"cbd10a90-73f0-486b-a2ca-9c900d3a441f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"977be20e-8c34-442f-8dfe-60e347997d28","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果将警告转换为错误，将使用你指定的异常。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1ea6e61f-4625-44f7-b149-6815517ce287","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外，还可根据异常来过滤掉特定类型的警告"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"c782a976-95d2-441d-b743-4a7c2b6744c4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a8492bbb-fa0d-4a81-ac28-09bc7eef8f4a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> filterwarnings(\"error\")\n>>> warn(\"This function is really old...\", DeprecationWarning)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nDeprecationWarning: This function is really old...\n>>> filterwarnings(\"ignore\", category=DeprecationWarning)\n>>> warn(\"Another deprecation warning.\", DeprecationWarning)\n>>> warn(\"Something else.\")\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nUserWarning: Something else.","collabId":"b5ff7899-e09b-47f3-a031-56fec7ac5f5c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Python/异常"],"createTime":1719226719535,"updateTime":1791474923035,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791474923035}}